{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43522","headline":"五言月夜啜茶联句 · 颜真卿","name":"五言月夜啜茶联句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"泛花邀坐客，代饮引情言。\n醒酒宜华席，留僧想独园。\n不须攀月桂，何假树庭萱。\n御史秋风劲，尚书北斗尊。\n流华净肌骨，疏瀹涤心原。\n不似春醪醉，何辞绿菽繁。\n素瓷传静夜，芳气满闲轩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"颜真卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43522.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43522","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}